  "key_findings": [
    "Release source is on a different history path from master: an earlier merge date alone does not establish stable inclusion; all availability claims compare immutable trees.",
    "SGLang template/runtime and spec.runtime are present only in inspected master; selector explicitly applies to single-node non-P/D. Default image is 0.5.14, which does not qualify current atlas SGLang release or advanced transfer.",
    "Stable includes EPP preset YAML but declares router 0.10.0; preset composition requires 0.11.0. With shipped defaults and no explicit/preserved config, schedulerConfigText is used. Master router default is 0.11.0.",
    "Master DisaggregatedSet feature gate defaults false. P/D presets request it; enabling the gate with CRDs can migrate current workloads. Migration deletes old workloads before replacements are ready.",
    "Master direct KEDA can target DisaggregatedSetRoleScaler. Zero replica and maxSurge zero fixes are included; source behavior remains unmeasured.",
    "Stable supports WVA paths and direct KEDA. Master retains WVA decoding fields but rejects new/changed WVA and reports old WVA scaling unsupported; migration requires explicit treatment.",
    "Stable/master dependency observations: LWS 0.8.0/0.11.0, GIE 1.5.0/1.6.2, router 0.10.0/0.11.0. Engine template llm-d-cuda 0.9.0 in both is not a vLLM package version.",
    "P/D duplicates model residency; two independently TP8-required roles require 16 GPUs, and rolling a full TP8 replica without spare GPUs cannot promise zero downtime."
  ],
